588
00:42:26,130 --> 00:42:27,960
They have zero ethics.

589
00:42:27,980 --> 00:42:30,450
Anda just died,
and they asked how she felt.

590
00:42:30,770 --> 00:42:32,230
Were they expecting her to be happy?

591
00:42:35,410 --> 00:42:38,450
I think we need to get to the bottom of this.

592
00:42:38,970 --> 00:42:42,710
Maybe it'll make those people
see things from Anda's side.

593
00:42:43,540 --> 00:42:44,340
Right.

594
00:42:45,110 --> 00:42:48,670
So, how much have you and Jin's friends
found out so far?

595
00:42:49,010 --> 00:42:51,940
We're taking a break to study for exams.

596
00:42:52,900 --> 00:42:55,800
As for Jin, I don't know how far he's gotten

597
00:42:55,820 --> 00:42:58,260
with tracking down Anda's phone and laptop.

598
00:42:58,450 --> 00:43:00,820
Why are you so desperate
to find his phone and laptop?

599
00:43:01,650 --> 00:43:04,200
Jin said it was suspicious
that those two things went missing.

600
00:43:05,120 --> 00:43:08,720
We asked the security guard,
but he wouldn't tell us who he sold them to.

601
00:43:09,500 --> 00:43:11,780
Oh, speaking of which...

602
00:43:12,560 --> 00:43:13,860
I'd better call Jin.

603
00:43:20,530 --> 00:43:22,460
He's calling Jin?

604
00:43:25,990 --> 00:43:27,310
What are you guys smiling at?

605
00:43:28,380 --> 00:43:29,410
Nothing.

606
00:43:29,440 --> 00:43:31,250
Nothing. Go ahead.

607
00:43:31,410 --> 00:43:33,620
Call whoever you want.

608
00:43:33,860 --> 00:43:35,150
What's wrong with you guys?

609
00:43:35,180 --> 00:43:37,030
Take your time. Off you go.

610
00:43:37,050 --> 00:43:38,170
