611
00:43:38,770 --> 00:43:40,090
Your cheeks are turning red.

612
00:43:42,380 --> 00:43:43,340
Hello?

613
00:43:44,000 --> 00:43:45,640
I kinda ship them.

614
00:43:45,660 --> 00:43:47,190
Hey, Podduang.

615
00:43:47,210 --> 00:43:49,100
I was just about to call you.

616
00:43:49,130 --> 00:43:51,580
I'm having Art and Tod
look for the laptop and phone

617
00:43:51,610 --> 00:43:53,050
