618
00:43:54,810 --> 00:43:56,080
At thrift stores?

619
00:43:56,380 --> 00:43:59,390
Yeah, I'm having them
check thrift stores first

620
00:43:59,420 --> 00:44:02,220
since we have no lead from the security guard
about where he sold them.

621
00:44:02,380 --> 00:44:03,940
I see, so...

622
00:44:04,660 --> 00:44:07,080
do you think you'll find anything

623
00:44:07,100 --> 00:44:10,020
on Anda's laptop and phone?

624
00:44:10,110 --> 00:44:11,090
I don't know,

625
00:44:11,250 --> 00:44:13,340
but I think they're the easiest places to start.

626
00:44:13,360 --> 00:44:16,230
At least we'll know who he was talking to
before he died.

627
00:44:16,720 --> 00:44:17,520
Okay.

